  "prompt": "For each category, which two products have the highest unit cost? When products of a category tie on unit cost, the lower product_id comes first. Return four columns, in this order: category_id, product_id, unit_cost_eur and cost_rank, the product's place in its category, 1 or 2. Return one row for each such product. Any row order is fine.",
